    "detailed_description": "You are a Sphere, you are a Hero, you are... a SpHero!<br />\r\nThe jealous tetrahedrons and hexahedrons have had enough of your no-corner business and decided to take over Spheria.<br />\r\nUse your Spherical powers to overcome your enemies and the trials ahead. You will be able to roll faster, bounce higher, throw fireballs or be a rolling magnet!<br />\r\nVenture in 60 hand crafted levels and defeat 6 Boxes (bosses).<br />\r\nCustomize your costume and become the ball you always wanted to be with your own combination of patterns, flags and colors!<br />\r\nTraverse treacherous and challenging uniquely themed levels and make it to the finish.",
